  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="755dd856-f5b3-55a4-b2ec-5f747fd25550" activityNameId="6cc2f6c0-7a3a-5863-a4b9-1f3ba28b9e16" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat production system, specific heat demand 50W</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat production system, specific heat demand 50W
Production of components for an average heat production system for a building with a specific heat demand of 50 W per m2 heated gross floor area;
UUID: 57d819f6-82c3-3df3-a2c6-cbeebf12135b
Materials used for the production. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Energy use for the production and processing of the raw materials. No infrastructure of the production site included.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Average of different heat production technologies; including furnaces for gas, oil, wood pellets and wood logs; no system with heat pump in average included
Time period: Amount of material for average investigated in 2008. Process information partly from 1994 to 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product range for small and medium buildings used (10-100kW). 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_57d819f6-82c3-3df3-a2c6-cbeebf12135b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
